@startuml
' Sem skinparam aqui: a paleta e injetada por tools/render-puml.py
' para gerar as variantes light e dark a partir desta mesma fonte.
' Arestas [hidden] empilham os grupos verticalmente.

actor "Operator" as User
actor "Data subject\n(public LGPD route)" as Subject
actor "DPO" as Dpo

rectangle "Frontend" {
  component "Web — Next.js 15 / React 19\nServer-Component first\n37 pages" as WEB
  component "Mobile — Expo 52\nhand-rolled PKCE" as MOB
}

rectangle "API — NestJS 10 on Fastify" {
  component "24 modules · 39 controllers\n140 REST routes · 1 SSE stream" as API
  component "Guards: JWT → OperatorContext → Roles\nRLS context set before every query" as GUARD
}

rectangle "Workers — Python 3.12" {
  component "25 supervised asyncio tasks\nRedis Streams consumer groups" as WRK
  component "LOCAL models\nspaCy · XLM-RoBERTa · distiluse 512d" as LOCAL
}

database "PostgreSQL + pgvector\n82 tables · 146 migrations\n29 with RLS · 5 DB roles" as DB
queue "Redis Streams\nevents · DLQ · cost caps" as REDIS
storage "Tigris S3\nmodel weights · exports" as S3

cloud "External" {
  component "Anthropic Claude Haiku 4.5" as LLM
  component "YouTube · X · Meta · RSS\nGDELT · Google Trends" as SRC
  component "Auth0 · Stripe · Sentry" as SVC
}

User --> WEB : HTTPS — access token never reaches the browser
Subject --> WEB : public route, no auth
Dpo --> WEB : RBAC-gated DPO panel
MOB --> API : REST + JWT

WEB --> API : REST, server-rendered
API --> GUARD
GUARD --> DB : Drizzle — RLS by operator
API --> REDIS : publish events
API --> LLM : strategy · term suggestion\n(forced tool-calling, cost-capped)
API --> SVC
API --> S3

REDIS --> WRK : consumer groups
WRK --> DB : raw SQL — schema owned by the API
WRK --> LOCAL : sentiment · entities · embeddings
WRK --> LLM : summary · narrative label · source discovery
WRK --> SRC : egress allowlist enforced
WRK --> S3 : model weight cache (~11 min cold boot)

note bottom of LOCAL
  Operator political positioning is
  regulated sensitive data, so embeddings
  run locally and never leave the process
end note

note right of DB
  Audit, metering and credit ledger are
  append-only by GRANT and trigger —
  the application cannot delete them
end note

WEB -[hidden]down- API
GUARD -[hidden]down- WRK
LOCAL -[hidden]down- DB
S3 -[hidden]down- LLM

@enduml
